# UnityMap frontend environment (Expo: values prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ are embedded
# in the JS bundle — restart `expo start` after changing this file).
#
# Full backend base-URL override (highest priority — skips ALL auto-detection and
# host probing). Use your PC's LAN IP when testing on a physical device, e.g.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.50:5000/api
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
#
# Host-only override (port comes from PRIMARY_PORT/FALLBACK_PORT). Use your PC's
# LAN IP when testing on a physical device, e.g. EXPO_PUBLIC_API_HOST=192.168.1.50
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_HOST=
#
# OPTIONAL direct-to-Cloudinary uploads (unsigned preset). When BOTH are set, the
# volunteer flow uploads photos straight to Cloudinary, then saves the returned
# secure_url via POST /api/reports. Otherwise the backend multipart path is used.
# Create the preset in Cloudinary dashboard: Settings → Upload → Upload presets
# → Add (Signing Mode: Unsigned). NEVER put CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET here.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_FOLDER=unitymap/barrier-reports
